OL,3,GNEWSATeenager denies sending racist
OL,4,Amessage to Lioness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has denied sending a racist
OL,7,Fmessage to England defender Jess Carter
OL,8,Fon Instagram.
OL,10,FAaryan Aggarwal, 19, allegedly used a
OL,11,Fracial slur after calling the
OL,12,Ffootballer "stupid" and "ugly" on 17
OL,13,FJuly 2025.
OL,15,FCarter was playing in England's
OL,16,Fquarter-final at the Women's Euro 2025
OL,17,Ftournament when the message was sent,
OL,18,FChelmsford Magistrates' Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
