OL,3,GNEWSATeenager denies sending racist
OL,4,Amessage to Lioness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAggarwal, of Dickens Rise in Chigwell,
OL,7,FEssex, pleaded not guilty to sending a
OL,8,Fpublic communication that was
OL,9,Foffensive, indecent, obscene or
OL,10,Fmenacing and will stand trial in March.
